{"id":"8198395909603c44","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-unification-problem.md","title":"有限合一目标与解集","display":"df-unification-problem — 有限合一目标与解集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-unification-problem","aliases":["56-df-unification-problem"],"display":"df-unification-problem — 有限合一目标与解集","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-variables]]","[[56-df-substitution-generality]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Definition 7.7.1; Theorem 7.7.6","source_printed_pages":"290–294","source_ocr_blocks":[311,312,313,314,315],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-unification-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-unification-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unification-problem — 有限合一目标与解集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7881759a56db8a3\" href=\"?note=e7881759a56db8a3\" title=\"56-df-substitution-generality\">56-df-substitution-generality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Definition 7.7.1; Theorem 7.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"290–294"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>311</span><span>312</span><span>313</span><span>314</span><span>315</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 及项替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{sub}}\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e7881759a56db8a3\" href=\"?note=e7881759a56db8a3\" title=\"56-df-substitution-generality\">56-df-substitution-generality</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(T\\times T)\">\\(\\mathcal P(T\\times T)\\)</span> 的新形式标记；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 为有限方程目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\\{E\\subseteq T\\times T\\mid |E|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathcal G_\\bot\\coloneqq\\mathcal G\\cup\\{\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\\{E\\subseteq T\\times T\\mid |E|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathcal G_\\bot\\coloneqq\\mathcal G\\cup\\{\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{(s,t)\\in E}(\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(t))\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{(s,t)\\in E}(\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(t))\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in S\\mid\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;(s\\sigma=t\\sigma)\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in S\\mid\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;(s\\sigma=t\\sigma)\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sol}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sol}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\mid\\forall\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\;(\\tau\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\sigma)\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\mid\\forall\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\;(\\tau\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\sigma)\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限目标用有序项对集合编码，方程的语义仍是对称相等。失败标记与空目标区分：前者无解，后者的解集为全部替换。有限目标属于原书定义7.7.1；Sol及MGU集合是将原书术语显式化的本地接口。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-generality","status":"resolved","id":"e7881759a56db8a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-generality]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$、$S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 及项替换见 [[56-df-terms]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]，$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]，$\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{sub}}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-generality]]。$\\bot$ 为不属于 $\\mathcal P(T\\times T)$ 的新形式标记；$E$ 为有限方程目标。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesi