":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in S\\mid\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;(s\\sigma=t\\sigma)\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sol}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\mid\\forall\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E)\\;(\\tau\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\sigma)\\}\\qquad(E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot).","display":true}],"bytes":2136,"backlinks":[{"id":"5252b28de1f68970","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"有限目标的MGU接口与完整的语法合一过程分别见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]、[[56-thm-mm-unification-correctness]]。"},{"id":"6e0a062a6861b59d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Vars}$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]。$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\operatorname{occ}_x$ 复用 [[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]] 的有限位置计数；$g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，$t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T$；$\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N$ 通过自由有限项结构递归定义。$u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N$ 为以下定义的三个目标测度。"},{"id":"38760d0fb2c20b34","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6ab7b6083e677200","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot,T,S,\\bot$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]；$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]；$\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]，$[x:=t]$ 与目标替换见 [[56-df-single-variable-substitution]]。$E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot$，$\\delta\\in S$；$G\\in\\mathcal G$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$f,g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)$，$m=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，各 $s_i,t_i,t\\in T$。以下六族中的方程 $e\\in T^2$ 由该族给出的等式确定，且要求 $e\\notin G$。"},{"id":"2a5690af909fbb4d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathcal V,t\\in T$，$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$\\sigma\\in S$，项和目标接口见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]，后缀项替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。"},{"id":"d1733562c097db66","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$T,S,\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{Sol}$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]，替换见 [[56-df-substitution]]。$D$ 为由 $E$ 确定的左变量集。"},{"id":"12f957d86ed7612e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem.md]]"},{"id":"28729f9f64189602","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3c6237425d7c09fc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3c8230787b91c51f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61b740fdfd46bce6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc","6aa7f56f36c897f4","491e726b9c1f42b0","e7881759a56db8a3"]}